\mt Front Matter
\imt1 unfoldingWord® Greek New Testament (UGNT)
\im \em An open-licensed, lexically tagged, morphologically parsed critical Greek New Testament with full apparatus. It enables the global Church to have access to the original texts of the New Testament.\em*
\imt2 Basis
\ip The UGNT text is based on the Bunning Heuristic Prototype Greek New Testament (BHP) -- see https://git.door43.org/Door43/BHP.  See the full rationale for the BHP text at https://git.door43.org/Door43/BHP/src/master/BHP.pdf.  Also, see http://www.greekcntr.org for more information.
\imt2 Changes from the BHP
\im The UGNT text differs from the BHP in only a few respects, which are:
\li Versification - The versification system used by the UGNT matches that of our ULT (at https://git.door43.org/unfoldingWord/en_ult). Currently, there is one difference:
\li2 BHP \em does not\em* have Acts 19:41 but UGNT does (see the commit at https://git.door43.org/Door43/UGNT/commit/9bb309780ad21ca9d26e5155a716437f004c4577).
\li Whole Verse Additions - The text of the UGNT is identical to the BHP except that we include several verses that the BHP omits.  These are wrapped in single brackets [like this].  The full list of verses that we include are:
\li2 Matthew 16:3; 17:21; 18:11; 23:14
\li2 Mark 7:16; 9:44; 9:46; 11:26; 15:28; 16:9-20
\li2 Luke 17:36; 22:43-44; 23:17
\li2 John 5:4; 7:53; 8:1-11
\li2 Acts 8:37; 15:34; 24:7; 28:29
\li2 Romans 16:24
\li Partial Verse Additions - We are compiling a list of commonly used variants which we will include with existing verses. A list will be provided here when they are available.
\li Metadata - The UGNT text includes various metadata to mark the text which create links to other content that our software uses.  For example, we add links to our translationWords (https://git.door43.org/Door43/en_tw) articles where appropriate (about 33,737 occurrences).
\li We remove the English style quotation marks that the BHP has (see the pull request at https://git.door43.org/unfoldingWord/UGNT/pulls/150).
\imt2 Related projects
\li unfoldingWord® Greek Lexicon at https://git.door43.org/unfoldingWord/en_ugl.
\li unfoldingWord® Literal Text at https://git.door43.org/Door43-Catalog/en_ult.
\imt2 Further information
\ip Further details about the UGNT can be seen at https://git.door43.org/Door43-Catalog/el-x-koine_ugnt#unfoldingword-greek-new-testament-ugnt.
